  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-M 609.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to define the criteria and procedures for conditional discharge of a person involuntarily admitted to a facility and for the revision and revocation of the conditional discharge.\n\nSource. #2748, eff 6-14-84; ss by #4205, eff 1-15-87; ss by #4810, eff 5-1-90; ss by #5554 eff 1-15-93, EXPIRED: 1-15-99\n\nNew. #7228, eff 3-31-00; ss by #9113, INTERIM, eff 3-25-08, EXPIRES: 9-21-08; ss by #9240, eff 8-23-08; ss by #12014, eff 10-25-16; ss by #13332, eff 1-25-22",
